OL,3,ASuspects hunted after police officer
OL,4,Ainjured in shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives said a man and a woman had
OL,7,Ffled the scene and that a firearm,
OL,8,Fwhich could be seen within the cordon,
OL,9,Fhad been found.
